[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=14 format=3]

; Dark palette lifted from reference/Cartalith Gen1 v2.10.html's :root CSS
; variables (bg/panel/panel2/line/ink/dim/faint/accent), re-expressed as
; Godot StyleBoxFlat resources + Theme type variations so main.tscn nodes
; opt in with a single `theme_type_variation` string instead of per-node
; style overrides. Applied project-wide via project.godot [gui] theme/custom.

